  "details": "I see there's a few requests for a fisheye camera, but I understand that's fairly computationally expensive since it requires either a super high res input texture or stitching together multiple textures/cameras, but since we have access to Spout, it would be nice if we could simply have a wider FOV option and then add the fisheye distortion in post.\n\nAt the same time it would also be really nice if there could be a bit more range on the telephoto side allowing us to zoom in a bit more.\n\nTLDR: Make the wide wider, and the zoom zoomier \n\n(and/or let us edit these limits in the config file)",
